EGEA Smart is the unique app that allow you to control, simply through your smartphone, your EGEA series heat pump water heater and TITANO TWIN series electric water heater. 
For example, you can:
-	turn on and switch off the water heater;
-	set the operative mode;
-	know and adjust the domestic hot water temperature inside the water heater; 
-	read the fault codes in the event of water heater malfunctions.
So, enjoy your smart life!
